---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - Matt Signorello"
  description="Privacy policy for mattsignorello.com, including analytics, direct contact links, outbound links, and basic website logs."
>
  <main class="wrap">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy.</h1>
      <p class="section-copy">Last updated: August 3, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <article class="content-body privacy-body">
      <p>
        This privacy policy explains how mattsignorello.com collects and uses basic
        information when you visit the site. This is a personal and professional website
        operated by Matt Signorello.
      </p>

      <h2>Information this site collects</h2>
      <p>
        This website is designed to be simple. It does not currently include account
        creation, ecommerce, comments, or an embedded contact form.
      </p>
      <p>
        The site may collect basic usage information through Google Analytics 4, such as
        pages viewed, approximate location, device/browser type, referral source, search
        traffic, and interactions with article, resume, contact, email, LinkedIn,
        GitHub, or TechBoot links.
      </p>

      <h2>Google Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site may use Google Analytics 4 to understand how visitors find and use the
        site. Google Analytics may use cookies or similar technologies to collect usage
        data. This information helps me understand which pages and articles are useful,
        what sites refer visitors here, and how the website performs.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can learn more about how Google uses information from sites that use its
        services at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Google's partner sites policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Direct contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you email me directly or contact me through LinkedIn or another external
        service, the information you choose to send is handled through that service. For
        example, an email you send will include your email address and whatever message
        content you provide.
      </p>
      <p>
        I use that information to respond to your message, discuss potential consulting,
        advisory, employment, or collaboration opportunities, and keep reasonable records
        of professional conversations.
      </p>

      <h2>Server logs</h2>
      <p>
        Like most websites, the hosting provider or web server may automatically keep
        basic logs that can include IP address, browser type, requested pages, referrer,
        and timestamps. These logs are used for security, troubleshooting, performance,
        and operational purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Outbound links</h2>
      <p>
        This site links to third-party websites, including LinkedIn, GitHub, TechBoot,
        Google, and other referenced sites. Those websites have their own privacy
        practices and policies. I am not responsible for how third-party websites collect
        or use information.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can control cookies through your browser settings. You can also use browser
        privacy controls, ad blockers, or Google's available opt-out tools if you do not
        want Google Analytics to collect information about your visit.
      </p>

      <h2>Information sharing</h2>
      <p>
        I do not sell personal information collected through this website. I may use
        trusted service providers, such as hosting providers, analytics providers, email
        providers, or professional tools, to operate the site and communicate with people
        who contact me.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This website is intended for a general professional audience and is not directed
        to children under 13.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        I may update this policy as the website changes, such as if I add a contact form,
        newsletter, new analytics tools, or other features. The updated date above will
        reflect the latest version.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy can be sent to
        <a href="mailto:matt@mattsignorello.com">matt@mattsignorello.com</a>.
      </p>

      <aside class="article-callout">
        <strong>Plain-English note</strong>
        <p>
          This policy is intended as practical boilerplate for a personal professional
          website. It is not legal advice. If the site later adds forms, newsletters,
          advertising pixels, or more advanced tracking, the policy should be reviewed
          again.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
